# Serve the static homepage for directory ("/") requests.
# The server's default directory index is index.php (a leftover from the old
# WordPress site), so it never fell back to index.html. This restores
# index.html as the homepage. index.php is intentionally omitted so a stale
# WordPress entry point can never be served if index.html is ever missing.
DirectoryIndex index.html index.htm
